<title>AUSTRALIA: GUD says to upgrade auto filter plant.</title>
<headline>GUD says to upgrade auto filter plant.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diversified manufacturer GUD Holdings Ltd said on Friday it will upgrade its automotive filtration manufacturing facilities after negotiating a long-term supply contract with the Repco auto parts group.</p>
<p>The two-year A$9 million upgrade would incorporate modern technology into the facility at Sunshine in western Melbourne and increase productivity, it said.</p>
<p>GUD said Repco, part of Pacific Dunlop Ltd, is the largest customer of its automotive filter subsidiary GUD Manufacturing.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
